sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant System
    participant DB

    User->>System: Login(name, pwd)
    activate System
    System->>DB: Validate(name)
    DB-->>System: OK
    System-->>User: Welcome
    deactivate System

    User->>System: Query(orderId)
    activate System
    System->>DB: Fetch(orderId)
    DB-->>System: Order
    System-->>User: Result
    deactivate System
